        { "visual": "'Can' expresa habilidad o capacidad: I can speak English (Puedo hablar inglés). She can use Excel (Ella sabe usar Excel).", "audio": "Can expresses ability or capacity: I can speak English. She can use Excel." },
        { "visual": "'Can't' es la negación: I can't drive (No sé/puedo conducir). He can't attend the meeting (No puede asistir a la reunión).", "audio": "Can't is the negation: I can't drive. He can't attend the meeting." }
